WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.169
Today we will build and repeat a rhythmic pattern. Our work connects with our own

00:00:05.169 --> 00:00:05.832
local community.

00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:09.324
Mark four beat spaces with dots on paper.

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:13.580
Choose claps and thigh taps to fill the beat spaces.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:17.580
Perform the pattern twice and check for a steady pulse.
